# Phase 4b: the art builder keeps running during playback (docs/
# phase4b-brief.md Revision 1 Decision 1 and Revision 2 D1): its decode
# buffer and the thumbnail LRU are reserved at shell start, never
# allocated once playback starts; it is unboosted, background priority,
# and (#58 idle build) touches storage during playback only while the
# user is idle (clock face up, backlight off), never while they are on.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p4b-art-playing.script
# needs: library
# fresh-db
#
# Trace rule "artio" (scripts/check_trace.py) fails if any "art io" line
# has playing=1 and idle=0 (storage touched with the user on).
# expect_art checks every album's state (OK / NOART / FAILED) against
# tests/ui/art_manifest.txt once the builder is done, none pending.

wait 4000
wait_db 45000       # the shell builds the database itself (fresh-db)

wheel +4            # "Shuffle Songs" (main menu)
wait 500
key SELECT          # plays across tracks
wait 2000
expect_playing 300
shot playing_start  # the builder is mid-run behind the WPS

wait 5000
expect_playing 6000 # no stop, no gap: the builder never boosts or
                    # stalls playback
shot playing_mid

audio_reload        # a real refill (a playlist change), no key: since
                    # #58 the builder ignores refills (no fill windows)
art_wait 40000      # block until the builder is idle (background,
                    # unboosted)
expect_playing 300
expect_art art_manifest.txt
shot playing_done   # still playing once the builder has finished

quit
